From 1b994f77a15946d6a45e2ec6907db7e74baf8d28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Strata lab <lab@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:18:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] F3.4/F3.5: compact file state images, last-use touch

GDN image: S0 = W_after - T W_before (bf16) + T only for heads whose operator is not ~0 (bf16, per-head mask)
+ conv rows; replaces before/after/T fp32 (470 MB -> 211 MB for a 7.7K-token file, T 226 -> 14 MB).
Store path v2-<id> (old images are not read). A successful compose touches the directory mtime so the
segments janitor deletes the least recently used first.
Checked: 12/12 answers identical to a normal read (F3.2 test); drift at 4 load alignments unchanged
(KL 0.047/0.029/0.023/0.042 vs 0.049/0.037/0.019/0.045); compose GPU 8 ms.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LHC9HuRHHgU5cu8SqUTYdk
